Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ishizu, do you still\Nthink destiny is on your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you finally faced up to the\Nundeniable truth that this duel is mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have seen the future quite clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba will lose at the hands\Nof his own Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I gotta hand it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She's about to get stunk, but\Nthat Ishizu's keeping her cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm starting to think that maybe\Nshe does know something we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Act or no act, she's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to Kaiba, most of her\Nmonsters are in the graveyard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Ashisu does lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the evil within\NMerrick grow even stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She joined this tournament\Nto help me defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,her brother and to uncover\Nthe good inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She has to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your most powerful monsters\Nare in the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon the rest of your\Ncards will join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of your plan, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba is so naive, believing that mere\Nskill can lead to victory in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool must accept his\Nancient past in order to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She has no idea what she's in for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's coming after my magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My face down card will finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Virus Cannon, wipe out 10 magic\Ncards in her deck. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to destroy your\Ndeck, or what's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, almost every magic card in your\Ndeck has been sent to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As if your deck wasn't pathetic enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,First, my crush card destroyed\Nall your high-powered monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my cannon did the same\Nthing to your magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck is no longer a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you still think\NI'm gonna lose? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've played into my hands, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you've sealed your own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of\Nyour false predictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My predictions are quite real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, you've fallen into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cards! They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have my trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Exchange of the Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card will be the beginning of\Nyour downward spiral toward defeat, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.79,0:03:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,At a cost of 1,000 life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,my trap replaces the cards in each of\Nour decks with those in our graveyards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But that leaves me with\Na deck of only six cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost have the entire\Nparagraph translated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll know exactly how\Nthe winged dragon of Ra works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Seto's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By playing Exchange of the Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isshisu brought all of her\Npowerful cards back from the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,graveyard and destroyed\NKaiba's deck at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isshisu hasn't lost her touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She strung Kaiba along just as she\Nused to string me along as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, Kaiba sent almost every monster\Nin Shizu's deck right to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she gets them all back along with\Nthe magic cards she lost last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaiba's not so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He had only six cards in his graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he uses them up, his deck will\Nbe empty and he'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's my turn, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Kelbeck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Kaiba's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could turn\Nthis around with just six cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He still has that Egyptian God\Ncard in his hand, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't he win if he played that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you with all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I'll be humiliated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I love seeing Kaiba squirm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finished\Ntranslating that card yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still one line left, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pick Virus Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You have chosen Virus Cannon, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your silence as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and play\Nyour trap card right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape what the future holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not listen to any\Nmore of this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate virus cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap will send it\Nstraight to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Muko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's the end of your cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon it will be the end of you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you accepted the power\Nof my Millennium Necklace yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you still deny that I have\Nalready foreseen your defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's Dark Gremlin's\Nstanding there doing nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,when everyone knows it's\Nstronger than her monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So why isn't Kaiba attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kaiba doesn't want to attack yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like\Nthe Kaiba I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, Kaiba's in quite\Na tough situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to summon his Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't have enough\Nmonsters to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he may be planning to sacrifice\NIshizu's monsters instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why he's not attacking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way for me to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I must summon Obelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu will cower in fear before the\Nvery Egyptian god card she gave to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I summon Zorga in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Kaiba will sacrifice my\Nmonsters to summon Obelisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,continuing his path to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I may only have a few\Ncards left in my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have everything I need\Nin order to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament of yours\Nis more than just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not seen the damage\NMerrick has caused so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The people he's harmed, you might\Nbe next. There is an ancient magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,at work that cannot be denied\Nand if you continue to ignore it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a fool all right let's go\Nmake your move you'll regret those
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,words kaiba zorgoth attack his dark\Ngremlin with cape of destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all. Come forth Kelbeck\Nand attack his life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.27,0:08:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,are you done no kaiba next i'll place\Nthis card face down and now i am
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,done ishizu's face down card must be a\Ntrap but what kind of trap is it well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,i know what i need to do avoid losing\Nmy life points long enough to summon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,obelisk the tormentor then this duel\Nwill be over i hope you're ready
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,ready to lose that is i draw activate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,track card muco my card it goes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,straight to the graveyard looks like\Nkaiba's running pretty low on cards to me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,if he still wants to summon obelisk\Nthen he better move fast you got that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,right but is it possible it's possible\Nbut it seems like a long shot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do this. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're going\Nto lose this, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your secret weapon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to summon Obelisk\Nnow if I'm going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll need to sacrifice\Nthree monsters first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where Ishizu comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Once she summons a third monster,\NI'll activate Soul Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It will let me sacrifice her monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I do, Obelisk is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this face-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One more direct attack in Kaiba's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So whatever face-down card\Nhe played better be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If what Ashizu said is true,\Nthere's nothing Kaiba can do to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his destiny to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the card Kaiba will\Nuse to sacrifice my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He will summon the Egyptian\Ngod I placed in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And then victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the end, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Play a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to have three on\Nthe field for my plan to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The face down card I've just played is the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,key to my victory and Kaiba's destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card has already begun working,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,infusing one of my own monsters\Nwith a dangerous weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A biotic blaster that will be hidden\Ndeep within the body of my creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.61,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When Kaiba sacrifices this monster,\Nthe weapon will transfer into Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.49,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon the monster, Ajito!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the stage is set for my sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The way Ishizu has toyed with\NKaiba's mind is quite amusing indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Ishizu is expecting\Nme to play Soul Exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I could be walking right into a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is my only\Nchance to summon Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must seize the moment now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kelvin! Agido! Zorga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These monsters are now in my\Ncontrol and will soon be sacrificed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Open face down card! Soul exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As I predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will summon\Nmy Egyptian God card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are getting interesting!\NAlright! Go, bro! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.19,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba sacrificed his sister's\Nmonsters so he could summon his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Still think I'm going to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see which is stronger, your\Nnecklace or my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting on a piece of jewelry in\Norder to win this duel is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To win a duel takes skill and\Nan extremely powerful deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When I attack you with Obelisk the\NTormenter and wipe out your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are sadly mistaken, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, when I secretly played the\Ntrap card Sacrifices Blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I infused my own monster\Nwith a self-destructing trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,One that now lives within\Nyour Egyptian god monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting to destroy it from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When you activated Soul Exchange and\Nsacrificed my three monsters to summon yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,this secret trap card infected\NObelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So as soon as you use it to attack me,\Nyour Egyptian God card will self-destruct,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,taking with it the remainder\Nof your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then finally, victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you may.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape from the defeat\Nthat awaits you in your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fat chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no monsters left to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So spare me the gloom and doom speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And just surrender to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,can Ashishu be right\Nabout Kaiba losing even
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,though he has an Egyptian\Ngod card on the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashishu predicted she'd win, but how can\NKaiba lose with Obelisk on the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Could her Millennium Necklace be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does Ashishu have a strategy\Nto defend against his attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.21,0:13:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can survive the Fury of Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That card belonged to me\Nbefore he even knew it existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it shall destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the future very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba will be completely unaware\Nthat my trap beats within Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack her life points directly, my beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment it begins to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,my trap card will be triggered,\Ndestroying Obelisk and Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You've ridiculed my powers and\Nturned my own creature against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.43,0:14:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel won't last much longer,\Nand once Kaiba's defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu will come looking for\Nher brother's good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, obelisk, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's activating by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.59,0:14:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel something strange inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.69,0:14:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check out Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, he stopped his attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of him, bro! This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt anything like this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this another one of Ishizu's tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are these visions\Nflashing before my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu's mind games must be getting to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stone carving of\Nmy blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should rethink my\Nstrategy and call off Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else is controlling\Nmy Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling is too strong to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Rod is affecting Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My instinct tells me\NObelisk isn't the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if my Blue-Eyes White\NDragon is calling to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should attack Ishizu with\NBlue-Eyes instead of Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This goes against my entire\Nstrategy I plan to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu with Obelisk from the\Nbeginning. But now I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I must summon my Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:16:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe as I activate my magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Silent Doom," which lets me summon\Na card from my graveyard. Gadget
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,soldier in defense mode This isn't\Nthe future my necklace predicted
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has changed Before\NI can summon my blue eyes white
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon. I must sacrifice two monsters\Nfirst. This... Oh no. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my Egyptian god card. Ridiculous!\NNo way, man! And what's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I decide my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, I sacrifice my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk and gadget soldier, I\Nsend you to the car graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could my millennium\Nnecklace have been wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so quiet, Ashisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your magic now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you realized that\Nthere's no such thing as destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now observe as I summon my blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So somehow Kaiba was able to change the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,future by summoning his\Nblue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Something from Kaiba's past\Nmust have awakened inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,for he was the ancient\Nkeeper of the blue-eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, if you could foresee all my\Nmoves, how did blue-eyes surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you're nothing\Nbut a fake, as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he shall see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish you off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eye's white dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out her life points\Nwith white lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.65,0:18:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this duel\Nis Seto Kaiba. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that you were going to win\Nthis duel all along, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's Millennium Rod must have shown\NKaiba the secret to winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it has something to do with the\Nimages on that ancient stone tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's destiny is connected\Nto the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I bet that's why he had to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now he'll believe in destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to overcome the fate that\Nmy Millennium Necklace showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your past is the key to your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won this duel for the same\Nreasons I'll win the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My superior skills and\Nintelligence. Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've taught me a valuable\Nlesson about the nature of destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that I am grateful, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have given me hope for\Nchanging the future of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I know the task will be\Nmore difficult than I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:19:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,To save the goodness trapped within,\NI'll need more than my millennium powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need the wisdom and the\Nstrength of the people around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,especially Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The brother she knew no longer exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have lost the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the process I have gained\Nsomething of far greater importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The realization that if I am to win\Nthis battle for my brother's spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will need your help, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, for I know you\Nwill help me save my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe whatever you need to, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm only in this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awesome duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are the best duelist I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Johnny Sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd start\Npreparing for our duel now, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right, Kaiba will\Naccept Destiny's role for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:20:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and my brother and the\Nworld will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
